WEBVTT

01:35.840 --> 01:38.240
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.390 --> 01:41.220
[Episode 14]

01:48.180 --> 01:48.710
Xuan.

01:49.120 --> 01:49.870
Drink up.

01:50.130 --> 01:50.570
Okay.

01:50.950 --> 01:51.470
Honey,

01:51.979 --> 01:52.780
happy time.

01:53.710 --> 01:54.350
Wow.

01:54.720 --> 01:56.240
Honey, you're amazing.

01:58.110 --> 01:59.050
Which episode is this?

01:59.050 --> 01:59.740
Episode 4.

02:00.050 --> 02:01.910
Zhou Mingde hasn't found out yet?

02:02.310 --> 02:03.640
This woman is so wicked.

02:04.810 --> 02:05.670
Watch with me for a bit.

02:05.670 --> 02:06.000
Okay.

02:08.919 --> 02:10.050
It's from my sister.

02:11.270 --> 02:12.130
Hello, Sister.

02:13.710 --> 02:14.490
I didn't forget.

02:14.490 --> 02:14.800
We...

02:14.800 --> 02:16.329
We'll go in a couple of days.

02:16.610 --> 02:17.670
Okay, don't worry.

02:17.820 --> 02:18.620
Alright. Bye.

02:20.360 --> 02:20.800
Is everything okay?

02:20.800 --> 02:21.360
It's okay.

02:21.360 --> 02:22.620
She asked us to go over.

02:24.760 --> 02:26.730
Princess, time to get up!

02:28.570 --> 02:30.480
Coming.

02:39.250 --> 02:40.450
It's still early!

02:40.520 --> 02:41.410
Early?

02:41.410 --> 02:42.850
It's already afternoon.

02:43.520 --> 02:44.970
Your aunt called.

02:44.970 --> 02:46.230
She asked us to go over.

02:46.640 --> 02:47.450
I'm not going!

02:49.250 --> 02:49.990
Why not?

02:50.410 --> 02:53.250
We go every year.
It wouldn't be right to skip this year.

02:53.250 --> 02:53.640
I...

02:53.800 --> 02:56.480
I have major courses this year.
Did you forget?

02:56.640 --> 02:57.200
Right.

02:58.140 --> 03:00.570
You just stay there for two days
and then come back.

03:00.570 --> 03:02.450
I have class tomorrow.

03:02.470 --> 03:03.500
Then let's go there
the day after tomorrow.

03:03.500 --> 03:04.130
Okay?

03:05.520 --> 03:07.800
Dad, I really can't go this time.

03:07.800 --> 03:10.320
I have an interview for Professor Ye's
course when school starts.

03:10.320 --> 03:12.980
I'm practicing every day.
Every second counts.

03:13.280 --> 03:14.120
Yeah.

03:15.250 --> 03:17.800
How can I be at ease
leaving you home alone?

03:17.800 --> 03:19.970
You're so forgetful.

03:19.970 --> 03:21.300
You might even get lost.

03:21.920 --> 03:25.010
When we get there, I'll take you out
for something good, okay?

03:25.010 --> 03:25.530
Why...

03:25.690 --> 03:28.640
can't I stay home alone?

03:28.800 --> 03:30.480
I can just order takeout.

03:30.640 --> 03:32.579
Takeout is so unhealthy.

03:32.970 --> 03:35.000
Alright. If she doesn't want to go,
don't push it.

03:35.000 --> 03:36.360
She goes there every year.

03:36.360 --> 03:37.970
Skipping one year wouldn't matter.

03:37.970 --> 03:38.410
No...

03:38.570 --> 03:39.079
It's just...

03:39.079 --> 03:40.250
Takeout is unhealthy.

03:40.250 --> 03:41.640
And she can't cook.

03:43.850 --> 03:45.480
Xiaole can cook.

03:46.970 --> 03:47.900
What's it to you?

03:50.450 --> 03:51.410
I'll call Tong.

03:52.020 --> 03:53.850
You're staying at Xiaole's place.

03:53.850 --> 03:54.200
No...

03:54.730 --> 03:56.260
Are you really calling him?

04:14.130 --> 04:16.760
Dad, I really can manage on my own.

04:16.760 --> 04:19.250
-What can you do?
-Don't ask him to come. I'm not going.

04:19.250 --> 04:19.850
You can't!

04:20.640 --> 04:22.079
I really can.

04:22.079 --> 04:22.810
Cut the crap.

04:23.080 --> 04:23.690
Mr. Yi.

04:24.370 --> 04:25.570
Xiaole, you're here.

04:26.130 --> 04:26.890
For the next few days,

04:26.890 --> 04:28.370
I'll leave her in your care.

04:28.370 --> 04:29.400
Your dad told you, right?

04:29.400 --> 04:29.760
Yeah.

04:29.760 --> 04:30.200
And

04:30.450 --> 04:31.100
remember:

04:31.250 --> 04:32.130
don't let her wander off,

04:32.130 --> 04:33.390
don't let her get hurt,

04:33.570 --> 04:35.520
and pick her up
and drop her off for class.

04:35.520 --> 04:36.200
Don't worry, Mr. Yi.

04:36.200 --> 04:38.010
My parents and I
will take good care of her.

04:38.010 --> 04:38.570
I object!

04:38.890 --> 04:39.690
I object!

04:40.340 --> 04:42.140
If you object, then come with me.

04:43.250 --> 04:45.510
He definitely doesn't want this either.

04:45.760 --> 04:46.270
Mr. Yi,

04:46.570 --> 04:47.960
if Yi Lan doesn't stay at my place,

04:47.960 --> 04:49.050
I'll report to you immediately.

04:49.050 --> 04:50.780
Then you can come take her away.

04:51.750 --> 04:52.810
It's settled then.

04:53.490 --> 04:53.970
Lan,

04:54.320 --> 04:55.850
take good care of yourself.

04:56.760 --> 04:57.130
Bye.

04:57.810 --> 04:58.450
Let's go.

04:58.690 --> 04:59.820
-Uncle Dong, take care.
-Lan.

04:59.820 --> 05:00.320
-Okay.
-Bye.

05:00.320 --> 05:00.890
Bye, Mrs. Yi.

05:00.890 --> 05:01.200
Bye.

05:15.640 --> 05:16.750
Just go home.

05:17.010 --> 05:18.540
I'll be fine here by myself.

05:20.960 --> 05:21.400
Oh.

05:25.080 --> 05:25.840
Mr. Yi!

05:26.490 --> 05:28.100
Yi Lan said I should...

05:28.250 --> 05:28.840
Come back.

05:28.840 --> 05:30.510
She said you should take care

05:30.640 --> 05:31.490
and stay safe!

05:39.520 --> 05:40.010
Then

05:40.320 --> 05:41.780
I'll go pack your luggage.

05:43.450 --> 05:44.010
No need.

05:45.640 --> 05:46.640
I'll do it myself.

06:07.760 --> 06:09.160
Are my shoes still there?

06:10.250 --> 06:10.610
Yeah.

06:15.720 --> 06:17.920
It's not like it's your first time here.

06:50.810 --> 06:52.840
S-Staying at your place is fine,

06:53.320 --> 06:54.890
but we need to set three ground rules.

06:54.890 --> 06:56.220
Stay out of my business.

06:56.320 --> 06:58.650
I couldn't care less about your business.

06:58.930 --> 07:00.530
What are the other two rules?

07:01.050 --> 07:02.160
I haven't thought of them yet.

07:02.160 --> 07:03.420
I'll tell you when I do.

07:12.450 --> 07:12.980
Where...

07:13.930 --> 07:14.960
Where do I sleep?

07:22.080 --> 07:23.880
I don't want to sleep in your bed.

07:23.930 --> 07:25.580
Well, if you don't sleep in my room,

07:25.580 --> 07:28.050
are you planning to sleep
in my parents' room?

07:28.050 --> 07:30.850
Where would they sleep
when they get back tonight?

07:37.720 --> 07:38.840
Look at this mess!

07:46.890 --> 07:47.810
I just woke up.

07:47.810 --> 07:49.470
It's normal for it to be messy.

07:50.130 --> 07:52.810
And my dad keeps praising you
for being tidy.

08:05.950 --> 08:08.550
Well, should I take off
your duvet cover first?

08:10.640 --> 08:11.700
What are you doing?

08:11.890 --> 08:13.720
Didn't I say I'm changing it to mine?

08:13.720 --> 08:14.100
Well,

08:14.760 --> 08:16.010
do you even know how to take it off?

08:16.010 --> 08:16.890
Of course I do!

08:16.890 --> 08:17.320
Move aside!

08:17.320 --> 08:20.050
-Just go back to get your duvet first.
-Right now.

08:31.720 --> 08:32.650
Rule number two:

08:33.130 --> 08:34.580
no physical contact.

08:41.330 --> 08:43.440
I... I'll go back to get my sheets.

09:40.730 --> 09:42.060
What are you looking at?

09:42.440 --> 09:45.300
You aren't looking for photos of yourself,
are you?

09:45.610 --> 09:46.330
No.

09:50.850 --> 09:51.520
I...

09:51.520 --> 09:52.990
need to head out for my class later.

09:52.990 --> 09:54.950
Can you give me a key to your place?

09:55.490 --> 09:57.560
No need. I'll be home all day today.

09:59.160 --> 10:01.010
What if you're not here tomorrow?

10:01.010 --> 10:01.680
Tomorrow?

10:02.890 --> 10:05.220
We'll worry about tomorrow when it comes.

10:05.520 --> 10:07.180
What time is your class later?

10:07.610 --> 10:08.400
4 PM.

10:09.040 --> 10:09.850
Oh.

10:13.090 --> 10:14.010
It's already 3:30 PM.

10:14.010 --> 10:14.920
3:30 PM?

10:15.490 --> 10:17.330
Then get out. I need to change.

10:29.490 --> 10:30.610
You only have 20 minutes left.

10:30.610 --> 10:32.170
You won't make it by bus.

10:32.250 --> 10:33.510
Even if you take a taxi,

10:33.970 --> 10:35.700
you'll probably still be late.

10:36.400 --> 10:38.250
Can I borrow your e-bike?

10:45.320 --> 10:46.610
You're seriously going

10:46.610 --> 10:48.940
to ride my e-bike with something that big?

10:55.130 --> 10:56.530
I'll just give you a lift.

11:00.010 --> 11:00.610
Thanks.

11:02.170 --> 11:03.590
Hurry up.

11:05.210 --> 11:06.010
Open the door.

11:14.610 --> 11:15.490
Me first.

11:15.490 --> 11:16.070
Why?

11:16.130 --> 11:17.690
This is my room now.

11:17.730 --> 11:18.520
This is still my house.

11:18.520 --> 11:19.760
You're just staying here temporarily.

11:19.760 --> 11:21.360
Move aside. I got here first!

11:22.130 --> 11:23.760
I've already got one foot in.

11:23.760 --> 11:24.490
Who got here first?

11:24.490 --> 11:25.220
I don't care.

11:25.370 --> 11:26.250
Ladies first.

11:31.640 --> 11:32.490
Yi Lan...

11:43.130 --> 11:44.590
Mom, Yi Lan is bullying me.

11:47.010 --> 11:47.520
Xiaole.

11:47.850 --> 11:49.850
Your dad and I got held up on the road.

11:49.980 --> 11:51.640
We won't be back for a few days.

11:52.130 --> 11:52.930
What's wrong?

11:53.010 --> 11:55.010
Is Lan settling in okay at our place?

11:56.040 --> 11:57.090
Everything is fine.

11:57.090 --> 11:57.840
Don't worry, Mom.

11:57.840 --> 11:58.850
Then take good care of her.

11:58.850 --> 11:59.860
Okay, got it.

12:00.520 --> 12:01.380
What happened?

12:03.610 --> 12:04.730
My mom said

12:05.370 --> 12:07.230
they aren't coming back tonight.

12:07.490 --> 12:08.310
How about

12:08.970 --> 12:09.370
I

12:09.640 --> 12:11.300
take you to your aunt's place?

12:11.610 --> 12:12.090
No!

12:13.250 --> 12:15.400
We agreed you'd stay out of my affairs.

12:17.330 --> 12:19.330
Get up. You're filthy!

12:21.330 --> 12:22.610
Like I'd even care.

12:35.730 --> 12:36.730
So noisy.

12:37.740 --> 12:39.580
When did he get so weird?

13:06.130 --> 13:06.640
Hello.

13:07.490 --> 13:08.080
Dad.

13:09.400 --> 13:10.140
What's up?

13:10.490 --> 13:11.550
You look like you're in a bad mood.

13:11.550 --> 13:12.350
What's wrong?

13:12.610 --> 13:13.400
Nothing.

13:13.520 --> 13:14.260
I'm fine.

13:14.780 --> 13:15.910
I just took a shower.

13:16.250 --> 13:17.520
Where are you?

13:17.640 --> 13:19.500
Where are Xiaole and his parents?

13:20.440 --> 13:21.490
Xiaole...

13:21.610 --> 13:22.790
is right next to me.

13:23.850 --> 13:24.570
Look.

13:27.730 --> 13:28.390
Uncle Dong.

13:29.610 --> 13:30.340
Don't worry.

13:30.400 --> 13:31.430
I just cooked for her.

13:31.430 --> 13:34.090
She ate two big bowls
and said it was really good.

13:35.130 --> 13:36.090
Thank you.

13:36.210 --> 13:37.040
No problem.

13:37.330 --> 13:38.800
I have to go now.

13:38.930 --> 13:39.330
Okay.

13:39.370 --> 13:39.730
All right.

13:39.730 --> 13:40.330
Bye, Uncle Dong.

13:40.330 --> 13:41.370
Bye, Dad.

13:41.520 --> 13:42.130
Good night.

13:42.130 --> 13:43.210
Bye.

13:43.250 --> 13:44.010
Good night.

13:46.090 --> 13:46.550
Xiaole.

13:46.970 --> 13:47.700
It's so late,

13:47.760 --> 13:49.620
and you're with your girlfriend?

13:50.210 --> 13:52.270
You were saying hello to her parents?

13:52.490 --> 13:53.490
You two made up?

13:54.590 --> 13:55.790
Don't talk nonsense.

13:56.250 --> 13:57.760
I'm out. You guys have fun.

14:03.010 --> 14:04.290
Can we talk?

14:07.280 --> 14:08.850
About what?

14:09.890 --> 14:11.980
Why have you been avoiding me?

14:16.160 --> 14:17.490
I've been avoiding you?

14:19.250 --> 14:20.490
You're the one who has been avoiding me.

14:20.490 --> 14:22.130
How dare you accuse me first!

14:22.850 --> 14:25.680
Not only did you stop calling
and reaching out to me,

14:25.680 --> 14:26.490
but you also

14:26.970 --> 14:28.970
got yourself other female friends.

14:29.490 --> 14:32.250
I have other female friends?

14:34.400 --> 14:35.080
Yes.

14:37.090 --> 14:38.090
After everything

14:39.850 --> 14:41.400
you said to me before,

14:42.730 --> 14:44.010
you fell

14:46.330 --> 14:48.060
for someone else that quickly?

14:53.370 --> 14:54.090
I didn't.

14:55.250 --> 14:55.910
Then you...

14:59.800 --> 15:00.640
Never mind.

15:55.130 --> 15:56.590
I'm going to take a shower.

16:21.710 --> 16:26.990
[Photographer] [Highlights] [Updates]

16:50.800 --> 16:53.130
Tong Xiaole, why do you have this photo...

16:59.680 --> 17:02.410
Are you just going
to keep staring at me like that?

17:20.369 --> 17:22.630
Hurry up and wash up. Breakfast is ready.

17:24.599 --> 17:25.740
I didn't bring any cosmetics.

17:25.089 --> 17:26.480
♪ I can see you once I open my eyes ♪

17:26.970 --> 17:28.640
♪ Silly me, can't help but gaze at you ♪

17:29.100 --> 17:31.880
♪ Your love is like a pink cloud ♪

17:32.980 --> 17:34.630
♪ Whenever you come near ♪

17:34.700 --> 17:36.770
♪ I lose myself in you ♪

17:34.730 --> 17:35.930
You're done already?

17:36.810 --> 17:37.690
I'm heading home.

17:37.680 --> 17:40.790
♪ The corners of my mouth turn up
simply at the thought of you ♪

17:37.890 --> 17:38.610
You're going home?

17:38.610 --> 17:39.130
Yeah.

17:39.440 --> 17:40.770
Why are you going home? Yi Lan!

17:40.770 --> 17:41.980
To get some stuff!

17:41.460 --> 17:43.040
♪ My IQ goes to zero ♪

17:43.320 --> 17:44.850
♪ Calories are my only cure ♪

17:45.400 --> 17:48.610
♪ I want a cup of boba tea with sugar ♪

17:49.530 --> 17:51.100
♪ With you around ♪

17:51.230 --> 17:53.410
♪ I feel like an untethered wild horse ♪

17:54.070 --> 17:56.270
♪ Love is the reason for gaining weight ♪

17:57.480 --> 18:00.500
♪ Boba tea with sugar means I like you ♪

18:00.960 --> 18:02.340
♪ Warm palms ♪

18:02.960 --> 18:04.540
♪ The pleasant smell of love ♪

18:04.830 --> 18:06.980
♪ I sync my playlist with yours
in secret ♪

18:07.100 --> 18:08.020
♪ Let our hearts beat in sync ♪

18:08.120 --> 18:09.340
♪ Let us breathe in sync ♪

18:10.060 --> 18:13.780
♪ I absolutely, totally,
and utterly adore you ♪

18:13.840 --> 18:14.760
♪ Boba tea with sugar ♪

18:15.180 --> 18:16.790
♪ My dream for each new day ♪

18:17.180 --> 18:18.790
♪ Is to hold you ♪

18:19.210 --> 18:20.750
♪ And have fun, hee-hee ♪

18:21.270 --> 18:22.500
♪ Without doubt ♪

18:22.550 --> 18:23.280
♪ The boba ♪

18:23.330 --> 18:24.500
♪ And pudding in my tea ♪

18:24.560 --> 18:25.850
♪ Are all yours ♪

18:26.260 --> 18:28.890
♪ You are everything I want ♪

18:31.150 --> 18:32.560
♪ Can I add pudding in my boba tea? ♪

18:33.090 --> 18:33.770
♪ Sure ♪

18:34.660 --> 18:35.720
♪ Can I add boba? ♪

18:36.420 --> 18:37.110
♪ Sure ♪

18:38.770 --> 18:39.750
♪ Can I add anything? ♪

18:43.060 --> 18:44.720
♪ Then add me on WeChat! ♪

18:46.210 --> 18:49.100
♪ Boba tea with sugar means I like you ♪

18:49.640 --> 18:51.020
♪ Warm palms ♪

18:51.640 --> 18:53.220
♪ The pleasant smell of love ♪

18:53.520 --> 18:55.670
♪ I sync my playlist with yours
in secret ♪

18:55.790 --> 18:56.710
♪ Let our hearts beat in sync ♪

18:56.800 --> 18:58.080
♪ Let us breathe in sync ♪

18:58.760 --> 19:02.460
♪ I absolutely, totally,
and utterly adore you ♪

19:02.520 --> 19:03.440
♪ Boba tea with sugar ♪

19:03.860 --> 19:05.470
♪ My dream for each new day ♪

19:05.860 --> 19:07.530
♪ Is to hold you ♪

19:07.640 --> 19:08.370
Do you want some breakfast?

19:07.890 --> 19:09.490
♪ And have fun, hee-hee ♪

19:09.680 --> 19:10.130
Okay.

19:09.950 --> 19:11.180
♪ Without doubt ♪

19:11.230 --> 19:11.960
♪ The boba ♪

19:12.010 --> 19:13.180
♪ And pudding in my tea ♪

19:13.240 --> 19:14.530
♪ Are all yours ♪

19:14.940 --> 19:17.690
♪ You are everything I want ♪

19:48.770 --> 19:50.170
I'll go get you some milk.

21:01.850 --> 21:04.610
Xiaole, you're going out
to take photos this afternoon, right?

21:04.610 --> 21:07.570
I'm free today.
If you need an assistant, let me know.

21:15.160 --> 21:15.810
Sure.

21:15.890 --> 21:16.850
Then this afternoon...

21:16.850 --> 21:19.510
You're going out to take photos
this afternoon?

21:20.440 --> 21:22.130
Today's shooting schedule is pretty heavy.

21:22.130 --> 21:23.990
I probably can't handle it alone.

21:24.130 --> 21:25.440
I can help you.

21:26.770 --> 21:27.130
You?

21:27.850 --> 21:28.330
Yeah.

21:28.770 --> 21:29.330
Why

21:29.370 --> 21:31.100
do you suddenly want to help me?

21:33.370 --> 21:34.430
I'm short of money.

21:41.440 --> 21:42.810
Manman, sorry.

21:43.200 --> 21:45.810
I already have an assistant
for this afternoon.

21:45.810 --> 21:46.610
Thank you.

21:59.200 --> 21:59.600
Right.

22:00.050 --> 22:01.710
Dude, put the peace sign down.

22:02.610 --> 22:03.660
Look at my camera.

22:04.960 --> 22:07.560
Dude, can you put your arm
around her shoulder?

22:07.570 --> 22:07.970
Right.

22:09.640 --> 22:10.370
Beautiful.

22:10.530 --> 22:12.590
Miss, could you rest your hand on him?

22:14.810 --> 22:15.370
Not like that.

22:15.370 --> 22:15.770
Yi Lan!

22:16.130 --> 22:16.770
Come here.

22:17.720 --> 22:18.920
Miss, just like this.

22:19.050 --> 22:20.770
Rest your hand on his shoulder.

22:20.770 --> 22:21.110
Yes.

22:21.130 --> 22:23.790
Dude, wrap your arm
around her waist naturally.

22:24.530 --> 22:26.820
Then look into her eyes.

22:27.130 --> 22:27.810
Right.

22:28.160 --> 22:29.020
Just like that!

22:29.370 --> 22:30.030
Fill light.

22:34.570 --> 22:34.890
So beautiful.

22:34.890 --> 22:36.640
That jawline is simply perfect.

22:36.640 --> 22:37.050
One,

22:37.050 --> 22:37.370
two,

22:37.370 --> 22:37.770
three.

22:39.770 --> 22:40.330
Great.

22:40.530 --> 22:41.330
One more shot.

23:29.810 --> 23:30.940
Listen to this song.

23:38.590 --> 23:42.510
♪ You make me forget
all the noise and chaos around me ♪

23:43.230 --> 23:46.820
♪ You fill my future
with so much fantasy ♪

23:47.790 --> 23:51.690
♪ With you by my side, I walk
through every morning and sunset ♪

23:50.370 --> 23:51.030
Don't move.

23:52.050 --> 23:52.680
Biscuit crumbs.

23:52.210 --> 23:55.910
♪ Just wanna share the ordinary days
with you ♪

23:56.200 --> 23:58.400
♪ My heart won't stop its racing beat ♪

23:58.760 --> 24:01.220
♪ The sweetness when our eyes meet ♪

24:01.690 --> 24:05.370
♪ Each time we meet,
it's as if the dream goes on ♪

24:05.760 --> 24:07.900
♪ How I wish to tell you ♪

24:08.030 --> 24:10.410
♪ It's not a coincidence or a miracle ♪

24:09.530 --> 24:10.000
Yi Lan.

24:12.370 --> 24:15.130
♪ It's destiny ♪

24:12.400 --> 24:13.090
You...

24:15.390 --> 24:17.240
♪ Sharing my earbuds with you ♪

24:17.260 --> 24:19.400
♪ Connecting you to my heartbeat ♪

24:17.550 --> 24:19.350
haven't fallen for me, have you?

24:19.460 --> 24:21.470
♪ Scrolling up and down the playlist ♪

24:21.640 --> 24:25.030
♪ Disrupting the rhythm of my breath ♪

24:25.190 --> 24:29.060
♪ On repeat, the song
tells the secret I can't speak ♪

24:29.120 --> 24:30.750
♪ The smile at the corner of your lips ♪

24:31.110 --> 24:33.930
♪ Makes me wonder ♪

24:31.480 --> 24:32.130
It's okay.

24:32.640 --> 24:33.370
Anyway,

24:34.000 --> 24:38.710
♪ If Cupid's golden arrow
has finally found you ♪

24:34.440 --> 24:36.500
I've decided not to like you anymore.

24:38.730 --> 24:40.940
♪ Sharing my earbuds with you ♪

24:40.970 --> 24:43.160
♪ Sharing my earbuds with you ♪

24:43.230 --> 24:45.340
♪ Sharing with you ♪

24:45.410 --> 24:47.860
♪ Sharing my earbuds with you ♪

24:47.880 --> 24:52.390
♪ Sharing my earbuds with you ♪

24:52.460 --> 24:54.640
♪ Sharing with you ♪

24:54.720 --> 24:56.620
♪ Sharing my earbuds with you ♪

24:57.010 --> 24:58.740
♪ Sharing my earbuds with you ♪

24:58.770 --> 25:00.910
♪ Connecting you to my heartbeat ♪

25:00.810 --> 25:02.090
Stop kissing!

25:03.290 --> 25:03.890
Dad!

25:03.960 --> 25:05.330
U-Uncle Dong.

25:05.610 --> 25:06.090
I...

25:09.640 --> 25:10.900
What are you two doing?

25:10.960 --> 25:12.620
Did you just kiss my daughter?

25:14.640 --> 25:16.030
Mr. Yi.

25:16.060 --> 25:17.530
Mr. Yi.

25:42.480 --> 25:43.050
Xiaole.

25:48.050 --> 25:49.720
Are you and Lan together now?

25:51.920 --> 25:52.570
Mom.

25:53.400 --> 25:55.070
Please don't ask about this.

25:55.160 --> 25:56.770
I can handle it myself.

26:03.370 --> 26:04.570
Tong, say something.

26:07.850 --> 26:10.250
I didn't expect
you would get a girlfriend.

26:12.440 --> 26:13.650
Lan is a nice girl.

26:14.850 --> 26:16.370
She's always cheerful.

26:18.920 --> 26:21.050
Our families know each other well too.

26:23.850 --> 26:24.580
That's good.

26:27.770 --> 26:29.370
It's just that Mr. Yi...

26:30.850 --> 26:32.250
This is really annoying.

26:38.000 --> 26:40.090
What's really going on
between you and Xiaole?

26:40.090 --> 26:41.130
His parents weren't home.

26:41.130 --> 26:42.640
Why didn't you tell me?

26:44.830 --> 26:45.740
I'm furious.

26:48.330 --> 26:49.440
Are you two together?

26:49.440 --> 26:49.790
No...

26:52.090 --> 26:52.850
Not really.

26:52.920 --> 26:54.440
What do you mean by that?

26:54.440 --> 26:55.370
If you're not together,

26:55.370 --> 26:57.210
why were you two kissing?

26:58.000 --> 26:59.420
I'm going crazy!

26:59.720 --> 27:01.320
Did he take advantage of you?

27:01.770 --> 27:02.900
Did he force you?

27:04.000 --> 27:05.380
Fine, I'm going to ask him myself.

27:05.380 --> 27:05.680
Dad!

27:05.680 --> 27:06.810
Where are you going?

27:08.160 --> 27:09.440
Dad!

27:11.640 --> 27:12.530
How about...

27:14.440 --> 27:15.170
give it a try?

27:15.850 --> 27:17.330
Xiaole, tell us what you think.

27:17.330 --> 27:17.960
Well,

27:19.160 --> 27:19.920
about this,

27:20.240 --> 27:21.300
I'll listen to Dad.

27:24.680 --> 27:25.680
Mr. Yi

27:26.920 --> 27:28.130
brags about his daughter all day long,

27:28.130 --> 27:30.440
saying how great she is
and how well she plays the cello.

27:30.440 --> 27:31.470
He spoils her way too much.

27:31.470 --> 27:31.950
Yeah.

27:32.680 --> 27:33.540
In the future,

27:33.610 --> 27:34.600
our Xiaole

27:34.720 --> 27:37.050
is probably gonna have to put up
with a lot.

27:37.960 --> 27:38.440
Alright.

27:38.440 --> 27:39.320
Get ready.

27:39.440 --> 27:40.130
Mr. Yi

27:40.240 --> 27:41.440
will definitely be here any minute.

27:41.440 --> 27:41.900
Will he?

27:42.240 --> 27:42.940
Yeah.

27:43.640 --> 27:44.050
See?

27:44.440 --> 27:45.200
Go open the door.

27:45.200 --> 27:45.850
So soon.

27:47.770 --> 27:48.230
Xiaole.

27:48.400 --> 27:49.130
Come with me.

27:50.160 --> 27:51.620
Just follow my lead.

27:51.720 --> 27:52.650
Don't be scared.

27:55.850 --> 27:57.150
Coming.

27:57.440 --> 27:57.920
Easy, easy.

27:57.920 --> 27:58.720
Mr. Yi, come in.

27:58.720 --> 27:59.780
Please have a seat.

28:00.330 --> 28:00.730
Hurry.

28:00.890 --> 28:01.440
Lan.

28:01.530 --> 28:02.130
Have a seat.

28:02.130 --> 28:02.960
-Honey.
-Have a seat.

28:02.960 --> 28:03.670
Make some tea.

28:03.670 --> 28:04.770
I just made some good tea for you.

28:04.770 --> 28:05.170
Hurry.

28:05.530 --> 28:06.330
Serve the tea.

28:06.480 --> 28:07.610
I'll pass on the tea.

28:07.680 --> 28:08.370
Have a sip.

28:08.920 --> 28:09.970
Have some.

28:10.720 --> 28:11.940
As for this matter,

28:12.370 --> 28:13.630
I am also responsible.

28:13.680 --> 28:15.400
I shouldn't have let our Lan stay here.

28:15.400 --> 28:17.400
It caused you unnecessary trouble.

28:17.920 --> 28:19.120
But there is one thing

28:19.440 --> 28:20.440
I need to find out.

28:21.160 --> 28:21.920
Xiaole,

28:23.000 --> 28:24.480
what exactly are your feelings

28:24.480 --> 28:25.850
for our Lan?

28:28.370 --> 28:29.570
They are grown up now.

28:29.680 --> 28:30.400
As for their business,

28:30.400 --> 28:31.480
we should let them decide for themselves.

28:31.480 --> 28:32.100
We should

28:32.240 --> 28:33.040
stay out of it.

28:33.330 --> 28:34.000
Stay out of it.

28:34.000 --> 28:35.930
You're telling me to stay out of it?

28:36.290 --> 28:37.770
My daughter has suffered so much.

28:37.770 --> 28:39.240
And you're telling me to stay out of it?

28:39.240 --> 28:40.750
Your words are out of line.

28:40.920 --> 28:42.140
Xiaole is my son.

28:42.440 --> 28:44.200
I know his character better than anyone.

28:44.200 --> 28:45.400
The way you're doubting him

28:45.400 --> 28:47.260
clearly means you don't trust me.

28:49.370 --> 28:51.160
It's not that I don't trust you.

28:51.160 --> 28:52.560
And I'm not doubting him.

28:52.720 --> 28:53.780
Then... But our Lan

28:54.000 --> 28:55.800
would never make the first move.

28:56.160 --> 28:58.160
Xiaole must have taken advantage of her.

28:58.160 --> 28:59.420
My son is so excellent.

28:59.530 --> 29:00.920
What's wrong with Lan liking him?

29:00.920 --> 29:02.320
That's impossible!

29:02.440 --> 29:03.960
My daughter has never even been
in a relationship before!

29:03.960 --> 29:05.850
How could she possibly like him first?

29:05.850 --> 29:06.920
It was Lan who pursued him.

29:06.920 --> 29:07.920
I said it's impossible!

29:07.920 --> 29:09.920
Absolutely impossible!

29:10.440 --> 29:13.170
The two of them stayed alone together
for so long!

29:13.770 --> 29:15.480
A boy and a girl under one roof,

29:15.480 --> 29:18.090
who knows what Xiaole might have done?

29:18.160 --> 29:21.530
Who knows what could've happened?

29:21.680 --> 29:23.370
What are you doing?

29:23.370 --> 29:24.890
Nothing happened.

29:26.400 --> 29:27.400
Really? Nothing happened at all?

29:27.400 --> 29:28.160
Nothing!

29:28.890 --> 29:30.960
Mr. Yi, what are you doing?

29:32.400 --> 29:33.530
Calm down.

29:34.890 --> 29:36.420
Did you make the first move?

29:38.610 --> 29:39.290
Uncle Dong.

29:40.440 --> 29:42.320
I apologize to you and Lan.

29:43.090 --> 29:44.620
About what happened today,

29:44.640 --> 29:45.920
I was the one who made the first move.

29:45.920 --> 29:46.880
See that?

29:47.160 --> 29:47.640
Tong,

29:47.720 --> 29:49.200
he made the first move, right?

29:49.200 --> 29:49.480
Yes.

29:49.680 --> 29:50.850
Do you like our Lan?

29:52.480 --> 29:53.140
Uncle Dong.

29:55.480 --> 29:56.370
All this time,

29:57.160 --> 29:59.540
my feelings for Lan have been one-sided.

30:00.530 --> 30:02.400
But my feelings for Lan are real.

30:05.090 --> 30:06.420
Tong, did you hear that?

30:06.640 --> 30:07.540
One-sided.

30:07.850 --> 30:09.160
Do you know what "one-sided" means?

30:09.160 --> 30:10.130
One-sided.

30:11.610 --> 30:12.920
Xiaole, let me make this clear.

30:12.920 --> 30:14.040
Starting today,

30:14.200 --> 30:15.770
you are not allowed to see our Lan.

30:15.770 --> 30:16.570
Do you hear me?

30:18.330 --> 30:19.390
Let's go home, Lan.

30:26.610 --> 30:27.410
Let's go home.

30:41.200 --> 30:41.730
Alright.

30:42.200 --> 30:43.600
You acted like a real man.

30:43.920 --> 30:45.110
But remember this:

30:45.720 --> 30:48.160
you have to take responsibility
for your actions.

30:48.160 --> 30:48.960
Do you hear me?

30:50.160 --> 30:50.850
Got it, Dad.
